<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;GETACHEW GUGSA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Getachew Gugsa is a renowned researcher known for his groundbreaking work in medicine, with a strong connection to the University of Ioannina and Katholieke Universiteit Leuven. He is described as modest and dedicated to advancing medical knowledge."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF IOANNINA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Ioannina is an esteemed institution where Getachew Gugsa studied and honed his skills in medicine, contributing significantly to his future success."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KATHOLIEKE UNIVERSITEIT LEUVEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Katholieke Universiteit Leuven is a Dutch-speaking university in Leuven, Belgium, where Getachew Gugsa pursued his studies in the late 1960s and early 1970s, focusing on humanities and social sciences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Katholieke Universiteit Leuven is the specific university in Leuven, Belgium, where Getachew Gugsa pursued his studies in the late 1960s and early 1970s."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. MARIA PAPADOPOULOU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Maria Papadopoulou is the Dean of the Faculty of Medicine at the University of Ioannina, praising Getachew Gugsa's contributions and educational background."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. SOPHIA KATSAROU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Sophia Katsarou is a fellow researcher and colleague of Getachew Gugsa, who has collaborated on several projects and praises his exceptional work ethic and intellectual curiosity."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IOANNINA UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ioannina University is the specific faculty within the University of Ioannina where Getachew Gugsa studied and developed his research interests."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FACULTY OF MEDICINE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Faculty of Medicine is part of the University of Ioannina where Getachew Gugsa studied and later became an esteemed alumnus."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRESTIGIOUS JOURNALS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Prestigious Journals are where Getachew Gugsa's research has been published, highlighting his contributions to the field of medicine."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ETHIOPIAN SOCIETY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ethiopian Society is the subject of a seminal work by Getachew Gugsa, which acknowledges his academic mentors and colleagues at the Katholieke Universiteit Leuven."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACADEMIC COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Academic Community includes scholars, researchers, and institutions that recognize and support the achievements of Getachew Gugsa."&lt;SEP&gt;"The academic community is a nurturing environment that supported the growth of a scholar."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCH INTERESTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Research Interests refer to the areas of focus in Getachew Gugsa's work, particularly in innovative treatments for chronic diseases."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEDICAL KNOWLEDGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Medical Knowledge encompasses the body of knowledge and practices that Getachew Gugsa contributes to through his research and publications."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXCELLENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Excellence is highlighted in Getachew Gugsa's academic performance and contributions, recognized by his peers and institutions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRINDING WORK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Grinding Work describes the dedication and effort put into Getachew Gugsa's research and academic pursuits."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HUMILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Humility is a characteristic of Getachew Gugsa, as evidenced by his modesty in discussing his educational background and achievements."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TIME AT IOANNINA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Time at Ioannina refers to the period when Getachew Gugsa studied at the University of Ioannina, which was instrumental in shaping his research interests and methodologies."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EARLY 1970S&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TIME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Early 1970s is the timeframe when Getachew Gugsa pursued his studies at the Katholieke Universiteit Leuven."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LATE 1960S&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TIME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Late 1960s is the timeframe when Getachew Gugsa pursued his studies at the Katholieke Universiteit Leuven."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GETACHEW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Getachew is a scholar whose academic journey is highlighted through interviews with contemporaries and colleagues."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONTEMPORARIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Contemporaries are colleagues who interacted with Getachew during his academic career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COLLEAGUES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Colleagues are fellow academics who worked with Getachew at the university."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The university is the institution where Getachew and his colleagues worked and conducted research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0141</data>
    </node>
